The Broker is the leader of the [[Org/Althane/The Network|Network]]. They keep to themselves, working only through the handlers of their cells and their high-profile clients. A hood is drawn up over their face. Beneath it they are dark metal with wooden fittings, and a symbol no one has read is stamped into their forehead.

The Broker keeps a library, stacks of books on either side of a long table. A two-headed dragon, [[People/Althane/Terexanthes|Terexanthes]], stands with them there, and so does a man in a suit whose head is a burst of green flame. When scrying spells fell twice on one of the Broker's people, the Broker pulled that operative back.
